{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1606","id":4075953647,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87y8h3v","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1606","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1606.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1606.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1606","number":1606,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(storage): align canonical source blobs to Aliyun OSS","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Architecture decision\n\n- Aliyun OSS is the canonical blob provider for private authoritative source documents.\n- Supabase PostgreSQL remains the canonical metadata and control plane.\n- Aliyun ECS remains runtime compute, not durable blob authority.\n- Aliyun CDN is a future delivery layer and is out of scope here.\n- Supabase Storage buckets are retained for receipts, small artifacts, compatibility, and optional non-canonical replicas; none becomes the canonical source-PDF authority.\n\n## Real OSS bucket identity\n\n- Bucket: `ciecopilot-source-hk-prod-a7m4q2`\n- Region: `cn-hongkong`\n- Public endpoint: `oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com`\n- Private, Block Public Access enabled, Versioning enabled, SSE-OSS/AES256, Standard, ZRS.\n- Human console readback recorded object count 0.\n- Identity is server-side non-secret configuration metadata. No credentials are committed and browser-exposed prefixes are forbidden.\n\n## Historical evidence preserved\n\nHistorical Supabase Phase A apply receipts, local rehearsals, remote readbacks, SQL execution records, bucket-creation evidence, and historical zero-object readbacks remain unchanged. New living ADR/policy overlays define future authority without rewriting what happened.\n\n## Changed files\n\n- `.env.example`\n- `artifacts/launch-readiness/v1-aliyun-oss-storage-decision.json`\n- `artifacts/launch-readiness/v1-data-asset-contract-map.json`\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-beta-source-map.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-beta-source-map.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/supabase-audit/phase-b-full-9709-local-schema-projection-contract.v1.json`\n- `docs/architecture/PRIVATE_STORAGE_SPINE_ADR.md`\n- `docs/reports/INDEX.md`\n- `docs/reports/launch-readiness/2026-06-24-v1-supabase-clean-baseline-and-archive-decision.zh-CN.md`\n- `docs/reports/launch-readiness/2026-06-27-v1-data-asset-contract-map.md`\n- `docs/reports/launch-readiness/2026-06-27-v1-supabase-phase-a-clean-infra-plan.md`\n- `docs/reports/launch-readiness/2026-07-17-v1-aliyun-oss-canonical-source-storage-decision.md`\n- `scripts/storage-architecture/__tests__/aliyun-oss-storage-decision.test.mjs`\n\n## Schema gap\n\n- `schema_gap_detected=true`\n- `schema_design_required=true`\n- `accepted_table_design=null`\n- `migration_created=false`\n- `remote_migration_applied=false`\n\nThis PR does not force private source custody truth into public schema and does not declare `public.learning_asset_pointers` the canonical private source-object metadata authority. Candidate designs remain: extend `private.storage_object_manifest`, create `private.source_document_objects`, or use `public.learning_asset_pointers` only as an optional runtime-facing projection/reference after a separate schema/privacy/RLS review.\n\nA separately authorized 3–5 file pilot may use checked-in JSON/Markdown receipts without a prior remote migration. A separate metadata schema decision is required before full production import.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `git diff HEAD^ HEAD --check` — PASS\n- `node scripts/storage-architecture/__tests__/aliyun-oss-storage-decision.test.mjs` — PASS, 6/6\n- `python3 -m json.tool` over the five changed JSON contract artifacts — PASS\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — PASS, 0 violations\n- diff-scoped credential scan — PASS\n- committed-tree `.worktrees/` gate — PASS\n\n## Unrelated baseline failures\n\nTwo known failures are outside this storage documentation/contract change and are not repaired here:\n\n1. `npm run deploy:secret-scan` fails because no `dist/assets/*.js` bundle exists (`no_bundle_assets_found`), not because this diff contains a secret.\n2. The public launch copy guard flags unchanged `src/pages/paper-workspace/content/i18n.js:211` text (“official scoring”); the same failure reproduces on clean root `main`.\n\n## Explicit zero-remote non-claims\n\n- No OSS object was uploaded.\n- No OSS API was called.\n- No cloud credential was created.\n- No Supabase remote mutation or migration was performed.\n- No CDN was configured.\n- No production, launch, student-delivery, governance-acceptance, extraction-readiness, or scoring-readiness claim is made.\n\n## Reviewer gate\n\nApproval or merge of this PR must **not** be treated as authorization to create a RAM role/user, apply a RAM policy, verify or use an OSS internal endpoint, perform any pilot or full upload, perform remote readback, apply a Supabase migration, configure lifecycle, enable CDN, or create a derived/student-facing asset bucket. Each requires a separately authorized human-controlled phase.\n","created_at":"2026-07-17T11:03:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T09:13:52Z","closed_at":"2026-07-18T09:02:12Z","merged_at":"2026-07-18T09:02:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"ee035f80fc72589fc6732509439ee01ac820f47a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1606/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1606/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1606/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/6f33323c6ba9e3f67e0ce8f0c726c9848a55f518","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/20260717-aliyun-oss-storage-alignment","ref":"task/20260717-aliyun-oss-storage-alignment","sha":"6f33323c6ba9e3f67e0ce8f0c726c9848a55f518","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admi